\ Sort three slot values into ascending order with bubble passes.
\ A store pops index-then-value from the top, so "load both, store both
\ reversed" swaps two slots.
!3 !0 :
!1 !1 :
!2 !2 :

<1> <0> < { <0> <1> !0 : !1 : ; }
<2> <1> < { <1> <2> !1 : !2 : ; }
<1> <0> < { <0> <1> !0 : !1 : ; }

<0> | <1> | <2> |
